Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7915: report truncated TX-free events

The WA firmware may report a short completion in its own log. Record
when the host parser also receives one, with the completion count and
whether WED is attached. Rate-limit reports and keep the normal cleanup.

diff --git a/mt7915/mac.c b/mt7915/mac.c
--- a/mt7915/mac.c
+++ b/mt7915/mac.c
@@ -961,8 +961,10 @@
 
 		if (unlikely((u8 *)cur_info > end ||
 			     (size_t)(end - (u8 *)cur_info) < sizeof(*cur_info))) {
-			dev_dbg_ratelimited(dev->mt76.dev,
-					    "short TX-free event\n");
+			dev_warn_ratelimited(mdev->dev,
+				"short TX-free event: %u/%u MSDUs, %d bytes, WED %s\n",
+				count, total, len,
+				mtk_wed_device_active(&mdev->mmio.wed) ? "on" : "off");
 			goto out;
 		}
 
